# 统一行尾，避免跨平台 checkout 后满屏 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.syso binary

# 示例源文件保持原始字节，禁止行尾/编码转换：
#   demo_line.awl   是 GBK 编码
#   demo_station.db 是 UTF-8 BOM
#   *.csv           是 UTF-8 BOM + CRLF
*.awl -text
*.db  -text
*.csv -text
